WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.260
Hotline turns a weekly brief into posts ready for review.

2
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:10.340
It helps the team publish consistently with less coordination.

3
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:16.315
AI helpers plan posts, select footage, write captions and prepare sound.

4
00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:21.890
A person approves; the publisher schedules; results inform next week.

5
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.915
Approved posts and results become next week’s starting point.
